==Old English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*stōdą}}, from {{der|ang|ine-pro|*steh₂-||stand, set}}. 

Cognate with {{cog|goh|stuot||herd of horses}} ({{cog|de|Stute||mare}}), {{cog|non|stóð}} ({{cog|sv|sto||mare}}). The Indo-European root is also the source of {{cog|sq|shtazë||animal, beast}} and {{cog|cu|стадо||herd}}.

